  "notes": "Governmental funds cash basis; business-type activities accrual basis (Statement of Activities and Statement of Net Position print business-type on accrual), so business_type measure is net position from the proprietary Statement of Revenues, Expenses and Changes in Fund Net Position (p7); business-type disbursements total 748,302 printed on the Statement of Activities (p3); receipts total computed. Proprietary cash flows from p8 Totals column. Governmental: fund balance 1,150,691 + 2,014,407 - 2,184,093 + bond proceeds 1,750,000 - debt issuance cost 44,483 = 2,686,522. Beginning cash not printed (only cash basis fund balance), left null; ending cash = the printed cash lines on p4. Business: 3,627,886 + 1,003,059 - 748,302 = 3,882,643. Balance sheet: governmental lines from the governmental funds statement (p4, total 2,686,522 equals the government-wide governmental column p1); business-type lines from the government-wide Statement of Net Position (p1); 'Due in More Than One Year' 2,688,951 includes meter deposits 11,025 (p6). Airport Authority component unit excluded. Detail: General, Water and Sewer budgetary comparison schedules (pp9-11; Water/Sewer schedules are cash basis while the proprietary statement is accrual); Water/Sewer printed totals are operating only, so non-operating lines are outside_printed_total. No schedule for the nonmajor Debt Service fund. Read pages 1-11 of 11"
